# Rockbase USB WiFi map
# Format:
# VID:PID|CHIP|MODULES(space-separated)|IFNAME|NOTE
# - VID:PID should be upper-case hex, e.g. A69C:88DE
# - MODULES are passed to modprobe in order
# - IFNAME can be fixed (wlan0) or auto
# - NOTE is free text

# AIC Ugreen USB WiFi (Windows reports Service=aicusbwifi)
A69C:88DE|AIC8800-family|aic_load_fw aic8800_fdrv|auto|Needs USB net mode (not storage mode)
